## KingCRAB cosmogenic muons: drift and EL fields enabled.

/control/execute macros/KingCRAB_CosmogenicMuon.common.mac

/Geometry/KingCRAB/drift_field_on true
/Geometry/KingCRAB/el_field_on true
/Geometry/KingCRAB/EL_field_intensity 900 kV/m

/nexus/random_seed 41
/nexus/persistency/output_file KingCRAB_CosmogenicMuon_FieldOn
